# Applies to both the backend's and frontend's Docker build contexts (repository root — see
# backend/Dockerfile, frontend/corvale/Dockerfile, and docker-compose.yml). Keeps the build
# context small and avoids leaking local secrets; both Dockerfiles COPY only the specific
# subdirectories they need (backend/+shared/, frontend/corvale/+shared/), so excluding the other
# app's directory here is not required for correctness — only node_modules/dist/.env are.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.git
.env
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.desktop
**/.env.test
uploads
backend/uploads
docs/node_modules
docs/.vitepress/cache
docs/.vitepress/dist
frontend/corvale/src-tauri/target
.claude
*.md
